# Deny by default. Only files required by Dockerfile.test and its lifecycle
# validation are allowed into the build context. This keeps local .env files,
# credentials, keys, logs, backups, caches, Git metadata, editor state, and
# temporary artifacts outside Docker build inputs and layers.
**
!Dockerfile.test
!.dockerignore
!install.sh
!uninstall.sh

!bin/
!bin/**

!git/
!git/**

!shell/
!shell/**

!scripts/
!scripts/**

!tests/
!tests/**

!.githooks/
!.githooks/**
